  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Potential energy of cylinder at top position</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0009_d52b7ed5275b.png\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 177px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math> is the linear speed of cylinder when it reaches at bottom, then at bottom, total potential energy of cylinder is converted into kinetic energy,</p><p>i.e. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>U</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>I</mi><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>40</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>40</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"
